<H2>Notices</H2>

<UL>


If you want to tell the WWW Caving community anything then this is a
mechanism <em>you</em> could use.

<LI>From: Richard Gerrish(<A HREF="mailto:ECSRGERR@LIVJM.AC.UK">ECSRGERR@LIVJM.AC.UK</A>)<BR>
Congratulations on an excellent Web site it is really good.
As I am originally from Lancaster I would like to wish you 
all an excellent time in my home town. For those of you who
have not been caving in the Yorkshire Dales, welcome to some
of the best caves in the world. You may be lucky to catch me
in Ingleton but if not you will probably find me down a hole
somwhere nearby. Happy caving.
<LI>From: Ali Garman(<A HREF="mailto:agarman@rwa-net.co.uk">agarman@rwa-net.co.uk</A>)<BR>
Hiya to anyone who knows me, if you don't know me then anything anyone tells you about me is all lies. I had a look at this site many moons ago and it was boring but now it's really useful - keep up the good work Sean! If any of you would like a weekend of high tech digging in S. Wales then drop me an Email. I hope Neil doesn't get rescued too many times this year, cheers Ali
